# Supabase - set real values in Netlify (Site settings > Environment variables)
# and locally in .env.local (not committed). This file is intentionally empty
# so next build without env vars falls back to a dummy client instead of
# crashing with "Invalid supabaseUrl".
#
# Example (copy to .env.local):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-jwt
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-jwt
